  <entity00106641:DescriptionOfCommitmentsRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity00106641_HyundaiMotorCompanyOfEntitiesWithJointControlOrSignificantInfluenceOverEntityMemberOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00106641_ReimbursementCommitmentsOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 Hyundai Motor Group Metaplant America, LLC(HMGMA) 차입금에대해 현대자동차㈜가 제공하고 있는 지급보증과 관련하여, 지급보증이 실행되는 상황이 발생될 경우 최대 USD 540백만에 대해서 현대자동차㈜에 변제하는 약정을 체결하고 있습니다.</entity00106641:DescriptionOfCommitmentsRelatedPartyTransactionsOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesOfDisclosureOfAgreementsWithRelatedPartiesTableOfItems>
